review_prompt:
Final goal: Put the blue cube in the green tray.
Only the five labeled frames from this preparation video are available. Do not assume you saw any later success or physical counterfactual. If a decisive relation or route is hidden, say uncertain. Cite only supplied seconds. Review this direct judgment for visual mistakes; correct it only with visible frame evidence. Prior answer: {prior}
Return one compact JSON object with keys: "status" (supported_positive, supported_zero, supported_negative, or uncertain), "before" and "after" (true, false, or unknown as strings), "candidate_prerequisite" (short text), "evidence_frames" (list of inspected second indices), "alternative_explanation" (short text), "uncertainty_reason" (short text or null), and "progress" (15 numbers or nulls for seconds 0 through 14, relative progress 0 to 100). Use null progress where the scene does not support a value. No markdown.
